# Configuration Template for Financial Institutions
# 
# Column Descriptions:
# - Institution_ID: Unique identifier for each institution
# - Institution_Name: Full name of the financial institution
# - Initial_Reserve: Starting liquidity reserves (currency units)
# - Reserve_Ratio: Fraction of assets held as reserves (0-1)
# - Credit_Limit: Maximum interbank credit line (currency units)
# - Collateral_Haircut: Discount applied to collateral value (0-1)
# - Liquidity_Buffer: Additional emergency reserves (currency units)
# - Risk_Category: Credit rating (AAA, AA, A, BBB, etc.)
#
# Notes:
# - Reserve ratios must meet regulatory minimums (typically ≥ 0.10)
# - Credit limits should reflect counterparty risk assessment
# - Haircuts increase with asset volatility and risk category
